# E-Market Desktop

Cross-platform desktop client for the E-Market platform, built with Electron.

## Features

- Electron Forge + Webpack setup
- Installers for Windows, Debian and RPM

## Tech Stack

- Electron

## Getting Started

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ghostland-dev/emarket-desktop.git
cd emarket-desktop
npm install
npm start
```

Other scripts:

- `npm run lint`: echo \

